  "details": "Description\n\nWhen you press the Y key while chatting, the chat box closes before you can type anything. This makes it impossible to enter text. Since there’s nothing else to explain, meeting the 100-character requirement is really difficult. Today’s lunch was cup yakisoba.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nOpen the chat box and press the Y key to start typing. The chat box will definitely close. It’s really hard to write more than 100 characters about something this simple. Last night’s dinner was a bowl of kamage shirasu rice topped with simmered eggplant.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1913-a070c3378e-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file**: [output_log_2026-09-16_12-57-11.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_9eb9e203-3c33-4c31-b2f9-564213c730a7/1/file)\n\n---\n\nOriginal bug report [チャットボックスを強制的に終了させてしまうバグ](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/b6bfd8) in Japanese by 紙風船。, Translated with DeepL.com (free version)",
